cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use STARS Observatory in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "STARS Observatory"
abstract: "A demonstrative evidence instrument for State obligations under Articles VI & IX of the Outer Space Treaty. Fuses the public orbital catalogue (CelesTrak GP / SATCAT, GCAT) with the legal layer that governs it: per-State supervision burden, UN registration gap and lag, and Article IX decision-time compression case studies, propagating ~19,000 objects with SGP4 in the browser."
type: software
